`eg` is a wrapper of `errgroup` package, it can automatically cancel the context `egCtx` after `Go` returns an error

> // The derived Context is canceled the first time a function passed to Go
// returns a non-nil error or the first time Wait returns, whichever occurs
// first.

And `eg.Wait` returns the first error of `eg.Go`, it simplifies our logic a lot.
